    {
        "content": "<p>Now it's fascinating to look at that and really understand how it fits together, why the correct implied motive for <code>rec</code> is deduced, from the goal, the placeholder in the <code>fun</code>, <code>eq₁₂</code>, and <code>h₂</code></p>",
        "id": 630557414,
        "sender_full_name": "Paul Licameli",
        "timestamp": 1791590003
    }
]